            "```yaml\n"
            "[SECURITY]: OMNICRON-LEVEL\n"
            "[SURVIVAL]: < 0.01%\n"
            "[PENALTY]:  SQUAD WIPE & FULL MUTE\n"
            "```\n"
            "▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬\n"
