        f"> 💎 **JACKPOT:** `$50,000,000` + `God Role`\n"
        f"> 🍒 **LUCKY:** `$200,000` Cash\n"
        f"> 💀 **DEATH:** `1h Mute` / `Shame` / `Loss`\n\n"
