    {"id": 979, "q": "Which family is characterized by Pulvinate leaf base, Vexillary aestivation and Diadelphous stamens?", "o": ["Fabaceae", "Solanaceae", "Liliaceae", "Brassicaceae"], "a": "Fabaceae"},
